## ✅ Fully Implemented Features

### Core Gallery Features
- **Semantic Zoom** - Day/Week/Month/Year grouping with Google Maps-style zoom
- **Date Scrubber** - Interactive timeline on right edge with smart granularity
- **Tiles View** - Alternate grid view with smooth zooming
- **Dual-View Architecture** - Loader-based switching between Semantic/Tiles
- **MFT Scanning** - Win32 Master File Table enumeration (10-100x faster, requires Admin)
- **Frame Budget Scheduler** - Throttles tasks to fit 16ms frame window

### Media Processing
- **FileTypeRouter** - Centralized format detection for 170+ formats
  - 70+ RAW formats (Canon, Nikon, Sony, DNG, etc.)
  - 60+ image formats (JPG, PNG, HEIC, WebP, TIFF, etc.)
  - 40+ video containers (MP4, MKV, AVI, MOV, etc.)
- **Hardware Acceleration** - D3D11VA for video decoding via `HardwareAccelerationManager`
- **LibRaw Integration** - Full RAW camera file support with embedded preview extraction
- **Hybrid RAW Loading** - Preview (fast) vs full decode (quality) toggle

