### Performance Monitoring
**SystemMonitor** (`src/SystemMonitor.cpp/.h`) - Tracks:
- CPU usage (app + system)
- RAM usage (app + system)
- GPU load (all processes)
- VRAM usage (app + total)
- GPU name detection

**Note:** ScrollBench's [PerformanceOverlay.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/PerformanceOverlay.qml) does NOT display SystemMonitor metrics (only shows FPS/frame times). Main app's [StatsOverlay.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/StatsOverlay.qml) DOES display full metrics.

### Build System
- **Dynamic Build** - [build.ps1](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/build.ps1) produces [appSamsungGallery.exe](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/build/appSamsungGallery.exe) + [appScrollBench.exe](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/deploy/appScrollBench.exe)
- **Single EXE** (optional) - `build.ps1 -BuildSingleExe` for portable `ScrollBenchPortable.exe`
- **Static Qt Setup** - [scripts/setup_static_qt.ps1](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/scripts/setup_static_qt.ps1) automated static Qt compilation
- **Network Support** - UNC path (`\\\\Server\\Share`) handling via `QUrl::toLocalFile()`
- **MinGW Runtime** - deploy.ps1 includes libgcc/libstdc++ for portability

